#: kcmkded.cpp:55
msgid "Load-on-Demand services"
msgstr "Servicios de Carga-con-Demanda"

#: kcmkded.cpp:56
msgid ""
"This is a list of available KDE services which will be started on demand. "
"They are only listed for convinience, you cannot manipulate these services"
msgstr ""
"Ésta é unha lista dos servicios dispoñibles de KDE que serán iniciados "
"segundo a demanda. Só están listados por conveniencia, e vostede non pode "
"manipular estes servicios"

#: kcmkded.cpp:62 kcmkded.cpp:76
msgid "Service"
msgstr "Servicio"

#: kcmkded.cpp:63 kcmkded.cpp:77
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrición"

#: kcmkded.cpp:64 kcmkded.cpp:78
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: kcmkded.cpp:68
msgid "Startup services"
msgstr "Servicios no arranque"

#: kcmkded.cpp:69
msgid ""
"This shows all KDE services that can be loaded on KDE startup. Checked "
"services will be invoked on next startup. Be careful with deactivation "
"unknown services."
msgstr ""
"Isto amosa tódolos servicios KDE que poden ser cargados no inicio de KDE. Os "
"servicios activados serán invocados na próxima carga de KDE. Teña coidado coa "
"desactivación dalgún servicio descoñecido."

